{"text":"AllSpaceSemanticTokensProvider","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:18OUDSThemesContract30AllSpaceSemanticTokensProviderP","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/documentation\/OUDSThemesContract\/AllSpaceSemanticTokensProvider"}]}]}],"kind":"symbol","variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/oudsthemesorange\/orangethemeprogressindicatorcomponenttokensprovider\/spaces"]}],"references":{"doc://OUDSThemesOrange/documentation/OUDSThemesOrange/OrangeThemeProgressIndicatorComponentTokensProvider":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A class which wraps all "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"component  tokens of progress indicators"}]},{"type":"text","text":" for "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"circular progress"}]},{"type":"text","text":"  and "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"linear progress"}]},{"type":"text","text":"components."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Contains also references to semantic tokens providers so as to be able to use them to define the component tokens."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"This provider should be integrated as a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AllProgressIndicatorComponentTokensProvider"},{"type":"text","text":" implementation inside "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSTheme"},{"type":"text","text":" so as to provide"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"all tokens to the users. It helps users to override some of the tokens and assign them to an "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSTheme"},{"type":"text","text":" implementation to use."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Custom themes can use subclass of "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange\/OrangeThemeProgressIndicatorComponentTokensProvider","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" and apply the provider they need."},{"typ